@startuml
title MEDORA: Encounter Closure and Financial Settlement
!include ../../../../shared/templates/medora-style.puml
skinparam dpi 192
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam wrapWidth 230
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
|Doctor|
start
:Prepare encounter summary and follow-up plan;
:Submit encounter for completion;
|MEDORA System|
:Authorize doctor and validate encounter state;
:Check required clinical fields and mandatory work;
if (Closure checklist satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Sign summary and complete encounter;
else (no)
  :Keep encounter open and identify missing items;
  stop
endif
:Prepare eligible billable items;
|Cashier|
:Review eligible invoice items and issue invoice;
if (Payment received?) then (yes)
  :Record payment; the system appends a payment event and updates the balance;
else (no)
  :Leave invoice issued with outstanding balance;
endif
stop
@enduml
